Cell["\<\
This simply means, that we first select blade in position 1 from the blade \
which square to 1, then blade number 17, from the list which commute with \
aready selected \[DoubleStruckE][1]. 
Now from the list of blades, which commute with selected \
\[DoubleStruckE][2,3,4,5] we see, that \[DoubleStruckE][4,5,6,7] is in \
position 39 in the list. So next step is \
\>", "Text",
